/**
 * This Type represents all reconstruction algorithms in the form of an {@link MlTemplate.AtomicPipe}. This base Type
 * restricts all reconstruction atomic pipes to accept a single features `Data` as input, and should return at least
 * `reconstructions` and `residuals`. This Type is intended to be extended by developers of concrete reconstruction
 * atomic pipes.
 */
abstract extendable entity type Reconstruction.Algorithm.Pipe<DO> extends MlTemplate.AtomicPipe<{features: Data}, void, DO>
                                                                  mixes Reconstruction.Algorithm.Fields
                                                                  type key 'RCAP'
